---
import { taiwanFood, taiwanFoodAreas } from "../data/taiwan-food";
const { prefix } = Astro.props;
---

<details class="tw-extra tw-food" data-food-root>
  <summary>台北地道美食与小吃清单 <span data-food-count>0 / 19</span></summary>
  <p>
    遇见就吃，不必刻意跨区排队。19项是候选，勾选只记录想吃或吃过的项目，不用全部完成。
  </p>
  <label class="tw-food-filter" for={`${prefix}-food-area`}
    >按街区顺路找
    <select id={`${prefix}-food-area`} data-food-filter>
      <option value="all">全部街区</option>
      {taiwanFoodAreas.map((area) => <option value={area}>{area}</option>)}
    </select>
  </label>
  <ul class="tw-food-list">
    {
      taiwanFood.map((item) => (
        <li data-food-areas={JSON.stringify(item.areas)}>
          <label>
            <>
              <input type="checkbox" data-food-id={item.id} />
              <span>
                <>
                  <strong>{item.name}</strong>
                  <small>
                    {item.group} · {item.areas.join(" / ")}
                  </small>
                  <span>{item.note}</span>
                </>
              </span>
            </>
          </label>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <p class="tw-food-storage" data-food-storage>
    勾选保存在当前浏览器，可跨日期方案保留。
  </p>
</details>
